          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "faq_title": "Is delivery free?",
            "faq_des": "<p> Yes. Worldwide shipping is already included in the price. We use DHL Express with a delivery time of 3 days. </p>"
          }
        },
        "template--14684877652053__bcb1cba3-80fc-49a2-a033-40cf0618e9c8-16659371170e440ef7-1": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "faq_title": "When will I receive my item?",
            "faq_des": "<p> After we receive your order, you will automatically receive a confirmation email. Orders placed before 2pm will be processed and shipped the same day. Delivery time is usually 2-4 working days. </p>"
          }
        },
        "template--14684877652053__bcb1cba3-80fc-49a2-a033-40cf0618e9c8-16659371170e440ef7-2": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "faq_title": "Can I change or return my item?",
            "faq_des": "<p> If you want to exchange a product for another model, color, etc., please contact us to reserve the new item in stock. You are entitled to an exchange or refund within 30 days of receiving the package, provided that the product has not been used. </p>"
          }
        }
      },
